OL,3,GNEWSAFourth man, 20, charged over
OL,4,AArmadale shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fourth man has been charged in
OL,7,Fconnection with the death of Billy
OL,8,FWatson who was shot dead in West
OL,9,FLothian.
OL,11,FWatson, 35, was fatally injured in a
OL,12,Fproperty on Harestanes Road, Armadale,
OL,13,Fat about 11:50 on Saturday 12
OL,14,FSeptember.
OL,16,FThe 20-year-old man is expected to
OL,17,Fappear at Livingston Sheriff Court
OL,18,Flater.
